   "line": [
    "h3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The little pawn to h3 restrains the light-squared bishop — and it screens a trap worth remembering: grabbing the e4-pawn with the knight loses a piece to a queen check on a4 and the follow-up on a5. It is very easy to forget.",
